    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/76856af4-6178-4099-a303-36aa2a25305a-image.png\" style=\"width: 236px; height: 175px;\" /></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>As angle of elevation of top of pole from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>C</mi></math> are equal So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi></math> must be circumcentre&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mi>R</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
